ers find  important right so I have an example  here hypothetical about North Korea but  we are actually seeing such  informational incongruity on Trump  Russia that lots of people barely  understand the scope of what is going on  and it makes it very difficult to  actually have conversations with others  when that's the case so just just  something to think about in total  informational incongruity going on here
 

